{"channel_version":"2baa9b983eead7d9f1901ce2480a5804085a3db7fedb8fc30edf8284cb66c5cd","logical_call_id":"convergence-Diversity-reader-9a28210778704b98:interface:c39308f8c9bb00f8e69c8b524927c8d5c4c3de9c3478086682d735ce023a7bdc","messages":[{"content":"Read the public source using each identified local unit below. Return the combined supplied JSON schema.\nUse the exact unit key as its source_anchor. Preserve entity and claim attachment; never exchange unit readings.\nRead local attributes/relations only, without returning a jurisdiction or native task classification.\nTemplate T0:\nRead the identified local source unit and return the supplied JSON schema.\nLocal unit: citizenship for the named source-local party pair.\nPreserve the supplied source anchor and cite contiguous evidence from the permitted source fields.\nUse unread with a null observation when a required attribute is unstated or ambiguous.\nrel_16e0ea8fea25: read only this local relation: {\"args\":[{\"field\":\"plaintiff_state\",\"op\":\"field\"},{\"field\":\"defendant_state\",\"op\":\"field\"}],\"op\":\"ne\"}. Source field meanings: {\"defendant_state\":\"citizenship state of the named defendant\",\"plaintiff_state\":\"citizenship state of the named plaintiff\"}\nTemplate T1:\nRead the identified local source unit and return the supplied JSON schema.\nLocal unit: same_pair_claims for the named source-local party pair.\nPreserve the supplied source anchor and cite contiguous evidence from the permitted source fields.\nUse unread with a null observation when a required attribute is unstated or ambiguous.\nrel_5b01605e27e9: read only this local relation: {\"args\":[{\"args\":[{\"field\":\"claim0\",\"op\":\"field\"},{\"field\":\"claim1\",\"op\":\"field\"}],\"op\":\"add\"},{\"op\":\"constant\",\"value\":75}],\"op\":\"gt\"}. Source field meanings: {\"claim0\":\"amount in whole thousands of dollars of claim 0 asserted by this same plaintiff against this same defendant, in textual order; cap at76 (76 means at least $76,000). Do not round a fractional thousand; use unread instead\",\"claim1\":\"amount in whole thousands of dollars of claim 1 asserted by this same plaintiff against this same defendant, in textual order; cap at76 (76 means at least $76,000). Do not round a fractional thousand; use unread instead\"}\nThe user input supplies each unit request with its literal source_anchor, template and entity context. Source_anchor is the unit key, never a template ID. Complete requires a populated observation and source evidence. Unread requires observation:null and evidence:[].","role":"system"},{"content":"{\"rules\": \"For this benchmark, diversity jurisdiction requires both complete diversity and a sufficient amount in controversy. No plaintiff may share citizenship with any defendant; citizenship may be shared within either side. For each plaintiff-defendant pair asserted in the facts, add only that same pair's claims. Do not combine different plaintiffs or different defendants. Each asserted pair must exceed $75,000. Equality to $75,000 is insufficient.\", \"source_text\": \"Elijah is from Missouri. Mia is from South Carolina. Lucas is from New Mexico. Charlotte is from West Virginia. Elijah and Mia both sue Lucas for wrongful eviction for $10,000 and trespass for $97,000. Elijah and Mia both sue Charlotte for breach of contract for $69,000 and copyright infringement for $26,000.\", \"unit_requests\": [{\"entities\": {\"defendant\": \"Charlotte\", \"plaintiff\": \"Elijah\"}, \"source_anchor\": \"citizenship_pair_0\", \"template\": \"T0\"}, {\"entities\": {\"defendant\": \"Lucas\", \"plaintiff\": \"Elijah\"}, \"source_anchor\": \"citizenship_pair_1\", \"template\": \"T0\"}, {\"entities\": {\"defendant\": \"Charlotte\", \"plaintiff\": \"Mia\"}, \"source_anchor\": \"citizenship_pair_2\", \"template\": \"T0\"}, {\"entities\": {\"defendant\": \"Lucas\", \"plaintiff\": \"Mia\"}, \"source_anchor\": \"citizenship_pair_3\", \"template\": \"T0\"}, {\"entities\": {\"claim_count\